{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12338","headline":"送族侄赴任 · 钱起","name":"送族侄赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林下不成兴，仲容微禄牵。\n客程千里远，别念一帆悬。\n欲欢卑栖去，其如胜趣偏。\n云山深郡郭，花木净潮田。\n坐啸帷应下，离居月复圆。\n此时知小阮，相忆绿尊前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}